Compile Demo with Visual Studio for 64 Bit

1st 
create an empty C/C++ project

2nd 
choose Platform Target -> x64

3rd 
add one of the files e9u_LSMD_LIB/bin_src/e9u_LSMD_easy-access.c or e9u_LSMD_LIB/example/e9u_LSMD_thread_example.c to your project

4th 
add the file e9u_LSMD_LIB/lib_x64/libe9u_LSMD_x64.lib to your project

5th 
in the menu
    Project 
    -> Properties 
    -> Configuration Properties 
    -> C/C++ 
    -> General 
    -> Additional Include Directories
add the path to e9u_LSMD_LIB/include

6th 
copy the file e9u_LSMD_LIB/lib_x64/libe9u_LSMD_x64.dll into the build directory
(were the .exe will be)

7th
comile and run
